OL,3,GNEWSALost building rediscovered thanks
OL,4,Ato old photo
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvidence of a lost building in the
OL,7,Fgrounds of a stately home has been
OL,8,Ffound by archaeologists after the
OL,9,Fdiscovery of a decades-old photograph
OL,10,Frevealed clues to its location.
OL,12,FThe image, taken during the hot summer
OL,13,Fof 1995, showed a series of parch marks
OL,14,Fin the grass at Temple Newsam in Leeds,
OL,15,Frevealing that something once stood
OL,16,Fthere.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
