OL,3,GNEWSALost building rediscovered thanks
OL,4,Ato old photo
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen members of the South Leeds
OL,7,FArchaeology (SLA) team saw the photo,
OL,8,Fit led to months of digging and the
OL,9,Fdiscovery of the foundations of an
OL,10,Foutbuilding, along with an array of
OL,11,Fobjects spanning thousands of years.
OL,13,FPhil Jones, who helped lead the dig,
OL,14,Fsaid everywhere the group had excavated
OL,15,Fat the Temple Newsam site had revealed
OL,16,F"a few surprises".
